      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "c9516142971a5088a453f337767e1dcb34135132365ae758004cbace1cd94da4",
      "text": "Take in the breathtaking view as your plane descends upon Rio de Janeiro, the “Marvelous City”, where green hills, turquoise ocean, sandy beaches and high-rise neighbourhoods come together in a unique blend. Your driver and English-speaking guide take you from the airport to the hotel, past colonial-style buildings and along the world-famous beachfront, framed by the Atlantic rainforest. A walk along the mosaic promenade of Copacabana reveals the life of the cariocas: a refreshing caipirinha as the waves lap the shore, games of foot-volley and crowds enjoying the sun.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "word_aligned",
        "fileId": "10dhj-ApZLYe73Yq6Xoxsx-6PXm248EjO",
        "documentSha256": "2f2b71ae65afdb3c0877b46018c75a20a0f5fa5ff288b307e3174ea5e54ce948",
